# {{lb|pt|ditransitive}} to [[give]]
## {{lb|pt|with '''[[a]]''', '''[[para]]''', or an indirect objective pronoun}}
### to transfer one’s possession of something to someone without anything in return
###: {{ux-lite|pt| '''Dar'''-te-'''ei''' um livro.|t=I '''will give''' you a book.}}
###: {{syn-lite|pt|ceder}}
###: {{ant-lite|pt|receber}}
### to [[hand over]] {{gloss|to pass something into someone’s hand}}
###: {{ux-lite|pt|'''Dá'''-me tua mão.|t='''Give''' me your hand.}}
###: {{syn-lite|pt|entregar|passar}}
### to make a present or gift of
###: {{ux-lite|pt|'''Dei''' flores à minha mulher.|t='''I gave''' my wife flowers.}}
###: {{syn-lite|pt|presentear}}
###: {{ant-lite|pt|ganhar|receber}}
### to provide a service
###: {{ux-lite|pt|A Igreja '''dá''' conforto aos pobres.|t=The Church '''gives''' the poor comfort.}}
###: {{ux-lite|pt|Ele '''dá''' aulas de latim.|t=He '''gives''' Latin classes.}}
###: {{syn-lite|pt|oferecer}}
### to [[administer]] {{gloss|to cause to take (medicine)}}
###: {{ux-lite|pt|'''Demos'''-lhe insulina. / '''Demos''' insulina a ele.|t='''We gave''' him insulin.}}
###: {{syn-lite|pt|administrar}}
### {{lb|pt|transitive}} to [[give]]; to [[issue]]; to [[emit]]
###: {{ux-lite|pt|O João vai-nos '''dar''' recomendações. /O João '''dar''-nos''-á''' recomendações.|t=John '''will give''' us recommendations.}}
###: {{ux-lite|pt|Ele gosta de '''dar''' ordens.|t=He likes '''issuing''' orders.}}
## {{lb|pt|with the indirect object taking '''[[em]]''' or an indirect objective pronoun}}
### to carry out a physical interaction with something
###: {{ux-lite|pt|Ela me '''deu''' um beijo./Ela '''deu'''-me um beijo.|t=She '''gave''' me a kiss.}}
### to cause a sensation or feeling
###: {{ux-lite|pt|A cerca me '''deu''' um choque elétrico./A cerca '''deu'''-me um choque elétrico.|t=The fence '''gave''' me an electric shock.}}
###: {{ux-lite|pt|Essa música me '''dá''' medo./Essa música '''dá'''-me medo.|t=That song frightens me.|lit=That song '''gives''' me fear.}}
### to [[cause]] {{gloss|to produce as a result}}
###: {{ux-lite|pt|Comer rápido '''dá''' azia em você. / Comer rápido '''dá'''-te azia.|t=Eating quickly '''gives''' you a heartburn.}}
## to [[yield]]; to [[produce]]; to [[generate]]
##: {{ux-lite|pt|Esse poço '''dava''' água.|t=That well '''used to produce''' water.}}
##: {{ux-lite|pt|As macieiras '''dão''' maçãs.|t=Apple trees '''produce''' apples.}}
# {{lb|pt|impersonal|transitive|followed by '''[[para]]''' when transitive}} to be [[possible]], [[can]]
#: {{ux-lite|pt|Não '''dá''' para ele fazer isso.|He '''can't''' do that.}}
#: {{ux-lite|pt|– '''Dá''' para o alcançarmos?<br>– '''Dá'''.|– '''Can''' we reach him?<br>– Yes, we '''can'''.}}
# {{lb|pt|transitive}} to [[throw]] {{gloss|to organise an event}}
#: {{ux-lite|pt|'''Darei''' uma festa amanhã.|t='''I’ll throw''' a party tomorrow.}}
# {{lb|pt|[[Appendix:Glossary#transitive|transitive]] with '''[[que]]'''; [[Appendix:Glossary#impersonal|impersonal]] with '''[[em]]'''}} to [[report]] {{gloss|[[publish]] or [[broadcast]] news}}
#: {{ux-lite|pt|O jornal '''deu''' que se cancelaram os eventos. / '''Deu''' no jornal que se cancelaram os eventos.|t=The newspaper '''reported''' that the events had been cancelled.}}
# {{indtr|pt|em|direct=1}} to [[result]] in
#: {{ux-lite|pt|Não te preocupes, não '''dará''' em nada.|t=Don’t worry, it won’t '''lead to''' anything.}}
# {{indtr|pt|para|aux=personal infinitive|.transitive|.or}} to [[suffice]], to be enough
#: {{ux-lite|pt|Com dez euros já '''dá''' para almoçar hoje.|t=Ten euros '''are enough''' to have lunch today.}}
#: {{syn-lite|pt|bastar}}
# {{lb|pt|transitive}} to [[make]] {{gloss|to tend or be able to become}}
#: {{ux-lite|pt|Ela '''daria''' uma boa professora.|t=She would '''make''' a good teacher.}}
# {{indtr|pt|por|como|ditr=1}} to [[consider]] {{gloss|assign some quality to}}
#: {{ux-lite|pt|Depois de semanas procurando, '''deram'''-nos como desaparecidos.|t=After weeks of searching, '''they considered''' us to be missing.}}
#: {{syn-lite|pt|considerar}}
# {{indtr|pt|.colloquial}} to [[defeat]] by a given score
#: {{ux-lite|pt|A minha equipa vai dar dois a zero à tua.|My team will beat yours 2-nil.}} 
